    "title": "How the Chicago Bears will feel Aaron Rodgers' impact this weekend at Soldier Field - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Kwiecinski ,\n9 hours ago D'Andre Swift is aware of the history that could be at Soldier Field on Sunday. It's just not any history that benefits his team. In fact, it's the Bears' boogeyman himself. Aaron Rodgers could take the field for the Steelers if he's deemed healthy. Swift knows that history doesn't factor into the present day, but he welcomes it all the same. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
